{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u258cCommand the Deadly Swarm: From Recon to Annihilation \u2013 Your Drone Arsenal Awaits</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will take direct control of a complete and lethal drone system, embodying the modern warfare doctrine of &quot;see it, destroy it&quot;:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf\u00a0<strong>Suicide FPV Drones</strong>: Become a battlefield daredevil. Dive first-person into targets and execute the ultimate art of one-shot, one-kill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf\u00a0<strong>Recon Drones</strong>: Hear thunder in the silence. Hover above the enemy and deliver precise, devastating judgment from above.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf\u00a0<strong>RPG-Launching Drones</strong>: Elevate infantry firepower. Deploy a mobile artillery unit suspended in the skies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From behind-enemy-lines reconnaissance to precision strikes, you are the pivotal link in the mission chain\u2014orchestrating a symphony of steel and fire with every drone at your command.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997110/extras/adf2d727e9840931b6947f24f6d468b4.poster.avif?t=1761920415\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997110/extras/adf2d727e9840931b6947f24f6d468b4.webm?t=1761920415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u258cMulti-Dimensional Battlefield Storm: Dominate All Fronts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your hit list spans the entire combat zone: Obliterate impregnable main battle tanks, hunt down patrolling naval vessels, eliminate high-value enemy infantry, and even challenge enemy jets for air superiority. Whether it's fortified structures or mobile units, nothing will survive the multi-axis storm of destruction you unleash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997110/extras/fc5c42636d69e817068041283a5a849f.poster.avif?t=1761920415\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997110/extras/fc5c42636d69e817068041283a5a849f.webm?t=1761920415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u258cImmersive Warzone Narrative: Live the Headlines</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond realistic battlegrounds\u2014from tense village ruins and dense concealment forests to complex industrial facilities\u2014you are no longer a spectator. You are on the ground, immersed in high-stakes missions at the heart of modern conflict. Experience the brutal, true face of drone warfare.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997110/extras/ffaa3bb9b5717b3b80602403a94ab545.poster.avif?t=1761920415\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997110/extras/ffaa3bb9b5717b3b80602403a94ab545.webm?t=1761920415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997110/extras/ffaa3bb9b5717b3b80602403a94ab545.mp4?t=1761920415\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u258cHardcore Operational Challenge: Survive by Skill Alone</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each mission is a full-scale military operation. From simple target confirmation to complex multi-phase assaults, enemy fire will saturate the air, and terrain will be your only ally. Whether executing precision strikes or advancing on multiple fronts, every task pushes your limits\u2014only razor-sharp precision and ice-cold tactical thinking will let you dance on the edge and dominate the battlefield.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997110/extras/05f291eccf3a44b26066bf6a311e4ca3.poster.avif?t=1761920415\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997110/extras/05f291eccf3a44b26066bf6a311e4ca3.webm?t=1761920415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3997110?t=1761920415","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997110/ca3d6a4fabeeb5fd960fcfc63f0b57280739eb8a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761920415","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997110/fb6edbd660d626edb1038bb4495e073fafff06b8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761920415","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997110/fb6edbd660d626edb1038bb4495e073fafff06b8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761920415","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u258cCommand the Deadly Swarm: From Recon to Annihilation \u2013 Your Drone Arsenal Awaits</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will take direct control of a complete and lethal drone system, embodying the modern warfare doctrine of &quot;see it, destroy it&quot;:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf\u00a0<strong>Suicide FPV Drones</strong>: Become a battlefield daredevil. Dive first-person into targets and execute the ultimate art of one-shot, one-kill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf\u00a0<strong>Recon Drones</strong>: Hear thunder in the silence. Hover above the enemy and deliver precise, devastating judgment from above.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cf\u00a0<strong>RPG-Launching Drones</strong>: Elevate infantry firepower. Deploy a mobile artillery unit suspended in the skies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From behind-enemy-lines reconnaissance to precision strikes, you are the pivotal link in the mission chain\u2014orchestrating a symphony of steel and fire with every drone at your command.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997110/extras/adf2d727e9840931b6947f24f6d468b4.poster.avif?t=1761920415\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997110/extras/adf2d727e9840931b6947f24f6d468b4.webm?t=1761920415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u258cMulti-Dimensional Battlefield Storm: Dominate All Fronts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your hit list spans the entire combat zone: Obliterate impregnable main battle tanks, hunt down patrolling naval vessels, eliminate high-value enemy infantry, and even challenge enemy jets for air superiority. Whether it's fortified structures or mobile units, nothing will survive the multi-axis storm of destruction you unleash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997110/extras/fc5c42636d69e817068041283a5a849f.poster.avif?t=1761920415\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997110/extras/fc5c42636d69e817068041283a5a849f.webm?t=1761920415\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></vid