 flying through jungles and islands. Use different drones for attack and defense missions. Every target tests your skill and courage in the brutal reality of war.","steam_appid":3997110,"support_info":{"email":"664490194@qq.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"Simplified Chinese, English","type":"game","website":null}